2296..2370 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2371..2445 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2446..2524 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2525..2596 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2597..2672 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2673..2753 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2754..2830 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2831..2907 Comment "/// compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
2908..2980 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
2981..2999 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
